  "title": "Shortest Clear Grid Path",
  "summary": "Find an eight-directional path through open cells.",
  "statement": "In a rectangular 0/1 grid, return the number of cells in the shortest path from top-left to bottom-right through zero cells using eight directions. Return -1 when impossible.",
